sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Proxy as Routing Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant SSRF as SSRF Allowlist<br/>InferencePool Watcher
    participant Prefiller as Remote Prefiller Pod<br/>Dynamic Port
    participant Decoder as vLLM Decoder<br/>localhost:8001/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over SSRF,K8sAPI: Background: SSRF Allowlist Maintenance
    K8sAPI-->>SSRF: Watch InferencePool CR updates<br/>HTTPS/WSS 6443<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    SSRF-->>SSRF: Rebuild pod IP allowlist<br/>from pool label selector

    rect rgb(230, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 1: Standard Inference (no disaggregated prefill)
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 8000/TCP<br/>No x-prefiller-host-port header
        Proxy->>Decoder: Forward request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 8001/TCP<br/>catch-all reverse proxy
        Decoder-->>Proxy: Inference response<br/>(streaming or non-streaming)
        Proxy-->>Client: Response
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 250)
        Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 2: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode (NIXL v2)
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 8000/TCP<br/>x-prefiller-host-port: <pod-ip:port>
        Proxy->>SSRF: Validate prefiller target<br/>against InferencePool allowlist
        SSRF-->>Proxy: Target allowed ✓
        Proxy->>Prefiller: Prefill request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS Dynamic port<br/>NIXL v2 protocol<br/>max_completion_tokens=1
        Prefiller-->>Proxy: Prefill complete<br/>(KV cache transferred)
        Proxy->>Decoder: Decode request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 8001/TCP<br/>with prefill context
        Decoder-->>Proxy: Decode response<br/>(streaming)
        Proxy-->>Client: Final response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over Client,SSRF: Flow 2 (blocked): SSRF Protection
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>x-prefiller-host-port: <malicious-target>
        Proxy->>SSRF: Validate prefiller target
        SSRF-->>Proxy: Target NOT in allowlist ✗
        Proxy-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    end
